{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方在油麻地拘捕一名貨車司機涉嫌販毒\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/DRUG-YMT-261128-2300.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方在油麻地截查一輛客貨車，車上檢獲懷疑毒品，拘捕一名司機涉嫌販毒。</p><p>司機黑布蒙頭，鎖上手銬，在現場協助調查，緝毒犬亦到場協助。晚上8時許，警員在麗翔道近巧翔街截查一輛可疑客貨車，在車上檢獲懷疑毒品，司機涉嫌販毒被捕。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:00:49.647404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T15:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:15:00.242573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T15:54:24.128539+00:00","content_hash":"7b8fb03f33caac9a3f2e042497089542871f9d9084a6b2d53cad6564adcc612e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}